 "script": "I went solar to kill my electric bill.\n\nNow I get two. The solar payment, and the electric bill. Whoa!\n\nHere's the thing. If you signed at your door, federal law gives you three business days to cancel.\n\nPast that? Don't panic. Three steps.\n\nOne. Find your contract. Is it a lease, a power agreement, or a loan?\n\nTwo. Read the cancellation and transfer clauses.\n\nThree. Write down what they promised, and what you actually got.\n\nThen get that contract reviewed before you pay anyone a dime.\n\nIf Homie can get out of it, so can you.",
